[b]GoneSmart v0.5.0-rc.1 pre-release[/b]

The new pre-release is now available for testing. I've updated the first post with the current compatibility information as well.

[b]GitHub release / APK:[/b]
[url=https://github.com/alagga/GoneSmart/releases/tag/v0.5.0-rc.1]https://github.com/alagga/GoneSmart/releases/tag/v0.5.0-rc.1[/url]

This is the first [b]release candidate for GoneSmart 0.5.0[/b]. It combines the three completed 0.5.0 workstreams so they can be tested together before the stable release.


[b]Highlights[/b]


[b]Bluetooth Audio Profiles[/b]

• Remember different GMMP Equalizer and Effects overrides for Bluetooth outputs.
• Keep the normal no-Bluetooth GMMP setup as [b]Standard[/b] and restore it automatically when appropriate.
• Use GMMP Equalizer presets, PRE and adaptive 2–10-band Equalizer layouts.
• Override Effects individually, including Balance, Force mono, Limiter, Bass boost, Tempo, Auto pitch correction, Virtualizer and Amplifier.


[b]Smarter Smart Auto-DJ[/b]

• Combines [b]Local Playlist Affinity[/b], [b]ListenBrainz[/b] and [b]Last.fm[/b].
• Adds Smart and Custom provider modes with optional source weights.
• Adds controlled near-tie variety, staged artist rescue and better caching for large libraries/playlists.
• Keeps the final playable choice local: GoneSmart only selects tracks that exist in your GMMP library.


[b]GMMP 4.2.1 compatibility and reliability[/b]

• Playlist Link is re-accepted on GMMP 4.2.1.
• Track Auto-DJ is re-accepted across normal playlists, Queue, playable file-browser rows and large Smart Playlists.
• Compatibility-sensitive GMMP lookups prefer semantic/structural validation and fail closed rather than guessing when a state-changing boundary is ambiguous.


[b]Prerelease note[/b]

This build is intentionally marked [b]prerelease[/b]. Please test the combined feature set before treating it as the stable 0.5.0 release, especially Bluetooth output switching, Equalizer/effects restoration, Smart Auto-DJ refills and Playlist Link/Track Auto-DJ on GMMP 4.2.1.

If something breaks, copy the companion app's [b]Logs[/b] view first and attach filtered Android Logcat when deeper diagnosis is needed.


[b]Install / update[/b]

Install GoneSmart-v0.5.0-rc.1.apk over your existing GoneSmart installation, then force-stop GMMP and reopen it. Existing GoneSmart settings are preserved. See the repository README and docs/INSTALLATION.md for full setup and troubleshooting information.
